<title>NEW ZEALAND: Dairy Brands sees NZ$0.9 mln 8 mth profit.</title>
<headline>Dairy Brands sees NZ$0.9 mln 8 mth profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dairy Brands Ltd on Thursday forecast an after-tax profit for the eight months to May 31, 1997, of NZ$0.9 million.</p>
</text>
